  <front>
    <title>BGP - Link State (BGP-LS) Advertisement of IGP Traffic Engineering Performance Metric Extensions</title>
    <seriesInfo name="RFC" value="8571" stream="IETF"/>
    <date year="2019" month="March"/>
    <abstract pn="section-abstract">
      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-1">This document defines new BGP - Link State (BGP-LS) TLVs in order to
carry the IGP Traffic Engineering Metric Extensions defined in the
IS-IS and OSPF protocols.</t>
    </abstract>
