      <section anchor="mappings-to-igp-source-sub-tlvs" numbered="true" removeInRFC="false" toc="include" pn="section-2.8">
        <name slugifiedName="name-mappings-to-igp-source-sub-tlvs">Mappings to IGP Source Sub-TLVs</name>
        <t indent="0" pn="section-2.8-1">This section documents the mappings between the Link Attribute TLVs
defined in this document and the corresponding advertisements sourced
by the IGPs.</t>
        <t indent="0" pn="section-2.8-2">For OSPFv2 and OSPFv3, the advertisements are defined in <xref target="RFC7471" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="RFC7471"/>.
For IS-IS, the advertisements are defined in <xref target="RFC8570" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="RFC8570"/>.</t>
